<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Real estate companies downgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Real estate companies downgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- PaineWebber on Tuesday downgraded its ratings for Bay Apartment Communities Inc, Bradley Real Estate Trust Inc, Public Storage Inc and Simon DeBartolo Group Inc, a PaineWebber source said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>-- All four companies were cut from buy to attractive.</p>
<p>-- Bay Apartment opened off 1/8 to 34-3/8 and Bradley was down 5/8 to 17-5/8. Public Storage was off 1/4 to 29 and Simon DeBartolo fell 1/4 to 29-3/4.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1730))</p>
